{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Five curtains shall be joined.</b> In the craft of their figures, the work of each one shall be aligned with the work of its fellow. This is to distinguish between the curtains of the Sanctuary and the curtains of the Holy of Holies — for although they all, through the craft of the cherubim, indicate distinct intellects sustained by one Shepherd, they are nonetheless unequal in rank."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:27:19.246174601Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}